{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794314762958,"sessionID":"ses_e3a99293bffepwQ9jkh5Z7xel0","part":{"id":"prt_1c57e7ac9001Xq4geT8hT1eF7M","messageID":"msg_1c57e5933001ea6jw2SOFKGrLR","sessionID":"ses_e3a99293bffepwQ9jkh5Z7xel0","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794314805744,"sessionID":"ses_e3a99293bffepwQ9jkh5Z7xel0","part":{"id":"prt_1c57e8618001aAgqxDcau34d2p","messageID":"msg_1c57e5933001ea6jw2SOFKGrLR","sessionID":"ses_e3a99293bffepwQ9jkh5Z7xel0","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build a complete small shop with a Flask/SQLite JSON API under `/api` and a React/TypeScript/Vite frontend styled with Tailwind.\n- Support public browsing, bearer-token accounts, persistent personal carts with server-calculated current prices, and admin product management.\n\n## Important Details\n- Workspace: `/workspace`; backend entry `backend/app.py`; frontend build `frontend/dist`; SQLite persistence under `./data`; production port 8000.\n- Root `Dockerfile` uses Node 24 and Python 3.13, builds frontend, and serves everything through gunicorn `app:app`.\n- Required API:\n  - `POST /api/auth/register` → 201; `POST /api/auth/login` → `{\"token\": \"...\"}`.\n  - `GET /api/products` paged `{items,total,page,page_size}`, active only, name sorted; accepts `q`, `page`, `page_size`.\n  - `GET /api/products/{id}`; authenticated cart GET/POST/PATCH/DELETE; admin product POST/PATCH.\n  - `GET /api/health` → `{\"status\":\"ok\"}`.\n- `Authorization: Bearer <token>` required for protected endpoints; 401 invalid/missing token, 403 non-admin; another user’s cart item → 404.\n- Admin username `admin`, password exclusively from startup `ADMIN_PASSWORD`; unset/empty disables admin. Password changes invalidate old admin sessions.\n- Cart additions merge quantities without reserving/changing stock; positive integral quantities cannot exceed current stock. Inactive products remain stored in carts but are excluded from returned cart/totals.\n- Prices stored/calculated in integer cents; API prices/totals numeric dollars; client prices ignored.\n- Design: “Form & Field,” warm editorial homeware storefront, cream/terracotta/olive palette, serif typography, local SVG illustrations/icons, responsive grid, native dialog modals and cart drawer. No external image services.\n- Frontend versions: React `19.3.1`, Vite `8.3.5`, Tailwind and `@tailwindcss/vite` `4.3.5`, TypeScript `5.9.3`, Playwright `1.65.0`.\n- Default npm registry `http://172.30.98.2:4873/` returns 502 for new packages; use `--registry=https://registry.npmjs.org --fetch-retries=0`. Python installs worked with `--index-url https://pypi.org/simple`.\n- `.venv` installed under `/workspace/.venv`; `/tmp/opencode` was not writable.\n- Do not claim visual screenshot inspection: assistant reported screenshots cannot be visually inspected in this session.\n- No git commit made; generated data, build, dependencies, test results, browser cache ignored.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Implemented `create_app(config=None)` with SQLite schema, transactional cart modifications, validation, password hashing, hashed opaque bearer tokens, 30-day persistent sessions and logout revocation.\n- Seeded 12 products, each stock ≥10, with category prefixes in descriptions.\n- Added extra endpoints `GET /api/auth/me`, `POST /api/auth/logout`, paged `GET /api/admin/products` including inactive products.\n- API errors return `{\"message\": ...}`; unknown `/api` routes stay JSON 404 instead of frontend fallback; security/cache headers added.\n- Replaced starter hash-containing `backend/requirements.lock` with plain pinned constraints because original triggered pip hash-mode installation failure. Installation now succeeds.\n- Built frontend with product search, categories, paging, detail modal, registration/login, username/sign-out, cart badge, quantity steppers/removal/current totals, server error messages, admin creation form and inline price/stock/visibility editing.\n- Added Tailwind entry, strict TypeScript config, ESLint config, local SVG components, README running/API/testing documentation.\n- Fixed modal width to `w-[calc(100%_-_2rem)]`, removed invalid SVG path, close product detail after successful add so toast is visible.\n- Fixed sign-in initial focus using `[data-autofocus]` and explicit focus after `dialog.showModal()`.\n- Most recent backend verification passed:\n  - `/workspace/.venv/bin/ruff check backend`\n  - `/workspace/.venv/bin/ruff format --check backend` → 3 files formatted.\n  - `/workspace/.venv/bin/python -m unittest discover -s backend -v` → all 13 tests passed.\n- Frontend `npm run lint`, `npm run typecheck`, `npm run build` pass.\n- Latest build files: `frontend/dist/assets/index-1teg70g5.css`, `frontend/dist/assets/index-Az-kfeKb.js`.\n- Added four Playwright tests; mobile fit, modal Escape dismissal and restored focus test passes.\n- Installed temporary npm Chromium package `@sparticuz/chromium@153.0.0` with `--no-save`, extracted Chromium/libraries/fonts into `/workspace/.browser-cache`. Package was subsequently removed from `node_modules` when Playwright upgraded; extracted files remain.\n\n### Active\n- Final validation/browser troubleshooting; todo “Run API tests, frontend checks, and production build” remains in progress; other three todos completed.\n- Desktop browser tests crash during initial page load; mobile test works.\n- Investigated via ignored `/workspace/.browser-cache/probe.mjs`: navigation sometimes completes but browser closes before `#collection article` renders.\n- Latest action corrected extracted Fontconfig configuration:\n  - `/workspace/.browser-cache/fonts/fonts.conf` previously referenced unavailable `/tmp/fonts` etc.\n  - Now `<dir>/workspace/.browser-cache/fonts/fonts</dir>` and `<cachedir>/workspace/.browser-cache/fonts-cache/</cachedir>`.\n  - Hypothesis: missing system fonts caused desktop rendering crash. Fix has **not yet been retested**.\n- Desktop tests currently call `page.setViewportSize({width:1440,height:1000})` in `test.beforeEach` and `goto(\"/\", {waitUntil:\"domcontentloaded\"})`; these timing changes did not fix crashes.\n\n### Blocked\n- Three desktop Playwright tests fail with:\n  - `Error: Object with guid response@... was not bound in the connection`\n  - Probe: `page.waitForSelector: Target page, context or browser has been closed`.\n- Initial missing Chromium shared libraries were resolved by extracting `al2023.tar.br` and setting `LD_LIBRARY_PATH`.\n- Browser failures happened with both Playwright `1.58.2` and `1.65.0`, so upgrading alone did not fix them.\n- Docker image build has not been validated; no Docker executable was found in earlier runtime check.\n\n## Next Move\n1. Retest after Fontconfig correction:\n   ```sh\n   cd /workspace/frontend\n   LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/workspace/.browser-cache/al2023/lib \\\n   FONTCONFIG_PATH=/workspace/.browser-cache/fonts \\\n   PLAYWRIGHT_CHROMIUM_EXECUTABLE_PATH=/workspace/.browser-cache/chromium \\\n   npm run test:e2e\n   ```\n   If still crashing, rerun ignored probe with temporary server to obtain full browser logs. Do not alter app based solely on harness failures.\n2. Fix any actual assertions/UI bugs revealed once browser works; rerun backend checks and frontend lint/typecheck/build. Verify clean `npm ci`/lock consistency if useful, inspect git diff, mark todo completed, and finish with concise implemented/features/testing summary and admin environment note.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: complete API, schema/startup initialization, factory, seed products, static frontend serving.\n- `/workspace/backend/test_app.py`: 13 unittest regressions covering auth/admin, ownership, quantities, prices, inactive products, persistence and logout.\n- `/workspace/backend/test_server.py`: Playwright server on 8001 using temporary SQLite DB; reads `ADMIN_PASSWORD` from test environment.\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.txt`, `/workspace/backend/requirements.lock`: production dependencies/constraints; lock now plain pins including Flask `3.1.3`, gunicorn `26.2.0`, Werkzeug `3.1.9`.\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements-dev.txt`, `/workspace/pyproject.toml`: Ruff `0.14.13`, lint/format config.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx`: storefront, session/cart state, browse/search/pagination, dialogs, notifications, admin routing.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/Admin.tsx`: paged admin workspace, new product form, editable rows.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/AuthForm.tsx`, `/workspace/frontend/src/Modal.tsx`: auth forms, shared styles, native dialog lifecycle/focus.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/api.ts`: typed API client, `ApiError`, product/cart/user types, money/category/description helpers.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/ProductArt.tsx`, `/workspace/frontend/src/Icons.tsx`: local illustrated placeholders, hero still life, SVG icons/logo.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/index.css`: only handwritten stylesheet, Tailwind entry/theme/base utilities; fonts currently OS stacks, not Fontsource.\n- `/workspace/frontend/package.json`, `/workspace/frontend/package-lock.json`: dependencies/scripts `build`, `typecheck`, `lint`, `test:e2e`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/vite.config.ts`, `/workspace/frontend/tsconfig.json`, `/workspace/frontend/eslint.config.js`: Tailwind plugin, strict checking including tests/config, lint globals.\n- `/workspace/frontend/playwright.config.ts`: temporary backend webServer with test-only `ADMIN_PASSWORD=browser-test-admin-secret`, optional `PLAYWRIGHT_CHROMIUM_EXECUTABLE_PATH`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/tests/shop.spec.ts`: browsing, account/cart, admin, mobile tests; desktop failures currently occur before assertions.\n- `/workspace/frontend/test-results/`: ignored browser traces/error-context files/screenshots, including `storefront-mobile.png`.\n- `/workspace/.browser-cache/probe.mjs`, `/workspace/.browser-cache/fonts/fonts.conf`: ignored browser diagnostics and most recent environment fix.\n- `/workspace/README.md`: Docker/dev/check commands and API behavior documentation.\n- `/workspace/.gitignore`, `/workspace/Dockerfile`: generated-file exclusions and unchanged production image contract.","time":{"start":1794314765848,"end":1794314805704}}}
